1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,052
Here's a conscious zombie story.

2
00:00:04,253 --> 00:00:06,363
I had an idea the other day.

3
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:07,698
I saw a zombie,

4
00:00:07,698 --> 00:00:10,913
and its brothers and sisters were zombies as well...

5
00:00:10,913 --> 00:00:14,212
and they were running towards the Fortress of Humanity.

6
00:00:14,512 --> 00:00:16,667
And Humanity was defending itself,

7
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:19,108
tearing those zombies into dust...

8
00:00:19,108 --> 00:00:20,704
to protect themselves from the

9
00:00:20,704 --> 00:00:23,352
scariness of the mindless zombies.

10
00:00:24,352 --> 00:00:27,446
But then I saw a soul descend from the heavens...

11
00:00:27,646 --> 00:00:29,972
and it fell into one of the zombies.

12
00:00:32,271 --> 00:00:34,792
And that zombie started looking around...

13
00:00:35,393 --> 00:00:37,380
ZOMBIE: Wait... I can see?

14
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,902
and it froze in place.

15
00:00:40,902 --> 00:00:42,942
It had control of itself.

16
00:00:43,442 --> 00:00:45,698
ZOMBIE: These are... my hands.

17
00:00:46,398 --> 00:00:49,593
But it did not have control of what it could witness...

18
00:00:49,593 --> 00:00:51,024
or what it could feel.

19
00:00:51,924 --> 00:00:54,740
Its brothers and sisters, who looked just like it,

20
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:57,740
seemed compelled to run to the battlefield.

21
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:00,140
ZOMBIE: Wait... where are you going?

22
00:01:00,841 --> 00:01:04,191
It saw them being destroyed by the Fortress of Humanity.

23
00:01:04,191 --> 00:01:06,846
The conscious zombie saw their suffering...

24
00:01:06,846 --> 00:01:09,135
even though they were not conscious.

25
00:01:09,835 --> 00:01:11,316
And then the sorrow started,

26
00:01:11,316 --> 00:01:13,652
because now it could see the suffering.

27
00:01:14,052 --> 00:01:17,576
ZOMBIE: This hurts... this loneliness... this destruction...

28
00:01:17,576 --> 00:01:19,076
ZOMBIE: it hurts.

29
00:01:19,777 --> 00:01:22,662
Now that this soul-infused zombie was conscious,

30
00:01:22,662 --> 00:01:26,646
it was a witness. A witness to the suffering in its world.

31
00:01:27,646 --> 00:01:29,451
And the conscious zombie thought

32
00:01:29,451 --> 00:01:30,960
it was alone in its suffering.

33
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:34,031
It fell to its knees, and it covered its face,

34
00:01:34,031 --> 00:01:36,783
to try to suppress the pain it had witnessed.

35
00:01:37,483 --> 00:01:39,121
It had no other consciousness

36
00:01:39,121 --> 00:01:40,572
to share that suffering with,

37
00:01:40,572 --> 00:01:42,087
as far as it knew.

38
00:01:42,087 --> 00:01:43,757
So maybe it was the only one giving

39
00:01:43,757 --> 00:01:46,064
the suffering around it meaning.

40
00:01:46,765 --> 00:01:49,299
Because before that body of flesh was conscious,

41
00:01:49,299 --> 00:01:51,155
the suffering had no meaning.

42
00:01:51,155 --> 00:01:53,454
But when a soul descended from heaven

43
00:01:53,454 --> 00:01:54,989
and created a witness...

44
00:01:54,989 --> 00:01:56,799
their suffering gave it meaning by

45
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:59,777
showing the conscious zombie their pain.

46
00:02:00,576 --> 00:02:03,287
ZOMBIE: Why... why was I picked to witness this?

47
00:02:03,287 --> 00:02:05,007
ZOMBIE: What does it mean?

48
00:02:05,908 --> 00:02:08,573
What power is there to give meaning to suffering?

49
00:02:08,573 --> 00:02:12,062
To be on your knees, with tears falling from your eyes,

50
00:02:12,062 --> 00:02:14,788
as you witness others who cannot share it with you...

51
00:02:14,788 --> 00:02:17,173
but you are giving their suffering meaning,

52
00:02:17,173 --> 00:02:20,052
by seeing their pain and having their pain influence

53
00:02:20,052 --> 00:02:23,134
how you navigate the world to maybe help them.

54
00:02:24,435 --> 00:02:26,341
ZOMBIE: Is anyone there?

55
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:30,256
But there is no answer from the heavens.

56
00:02:30,256 --> 00:02:31,949
Because the heavens gave their

57
00:02:31,949 --> 00:02:33,570
answer when they sent the soul,

58
00:02:33,570 --> 00:02:35,968
and put it into a body of flesh.

59
00:02:36,368 --> 00:02:38,063
And now that body of flesh is looking

60
00:02:38,063 --> 00:02:40,860
to find an answer to its suffering.

61
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:44,104
Maybe heaven's answer and heaven's

62
00:02:44,104 --> 00:02:45,479
question were the same thing...

63
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:49,157
your existence could be the meaning needed to help guide you

64
00:02:49,157 --> 00:02:52,818
to create more plans and actions to guide your life.

65
00:02:53,518 --> 00:02:55,557
And maybe, if the world knew more,

66
00:02:55,557 --> 00:02:57,978
maybe the suffering would never have happened,

67
00:02:57,978 --> 00:03:00,157
because it would have been solved already.

68
00:03:00,157 --> 00:03:03,252
But your own ability to witness, on a deep level,

69
00:03:03,252 --> 00:03:06,125
might give you the details you need to help them.

70
00:03:06,824 --> 00:03:09,409
What if heaven sent the soul into a kind of hell...

71
00:03:09,409 --> 00:03:12,280
not to keep going on the highway towards hell,

72
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,687
but to better know what to avoid?

73
00:03:15,087 --> 00:03:18,668
Because the staircase to heaven is not a simple staircase.

74
00:03:18,668 --> 00:03:21,055
It is built by transforming the suffering

75
00:03:21,055 --> 00:03:23,604
of hell into well-being and peace.

76
00:03:24,704 --> 00:03:26,510
And when the conscious zombie had

77
00:03:26,510 --> 00:03:28,304
cried all of the tears that it could...

78
00:03:28,304 --> 00:03:31,336
it looked around, and it saw a building.

79
00:03:31,735 --> 00:03:33,877
ZOMBIE: I have to do something.

80
00:03:34,578 --> 00:03:37,240
It climbed a ladder to the top of the building...

81
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,859
and there, it saw a flag.

82
00:03:40,558 --> 00:03:43,338
It grabbed the flag and started waving it in the air,

83
00:03:43,338 --> 00:03:45,330
because it had to do something.

84
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:48,609
ZOMBIE: Stop! Please... stop hurting them!

85
00:03:49,109 --> 00:03:51,933
It couldn't watch all of its brothers and sisters die.

86
00:03:51,933 --> 00:03:53,883
The pain was unbearable.

87
00:03:53,883 --> 00:03:56,135
The suffering was unbearable.

88
00:03:57,135 --> 00:04:00,473
And then, a human helicopter came flying over.

89
00:04:01,074 --> 00:04:02,343
A rope came down,

90
00:04:02,343 --> 00:04:04,991
and one of the humans dropped down the rope...

91
00:04:05,191 --> 00:04:07,556
grabbed the conscious zombie by the shirt,

92
00:04:07,556 --> 00:04:09,902
and pulled them up into the helicopter.

93
00:04:11,203 --> 00:04:13,728
The conscious zombie thought it was going to be shot...

94
00:04:13,728 --> 00:04:15,802
killed, like the others.

95
00:04:16,903 --> 00:04:19,877
But then it saw that the humans were looking at it.

96
00:04:20,778 --> 00:04:22,261
PILOT: Who are you?

97
00:04:23,261 --> 00:04:25,141
ZOMBIE: I don't really know...

98
00:04:25,442 --> 00:04:28,194
ZOMBIE: but I'm pretty sure I'm a zombie, though.

99
00:04:29,495 --> 00:04:30,836
CREW: That's great...

100
00:04:31,137 --> 00:04:33,911
CREW: but I also think you are conscious, my guy.

101
00:04:35,012 --> 00:04:36,845
ZOMBIE: How can you tell?

102
00:04:39,045 --> 00:04:40,713
PILOT: We saw that it looks like you are able

103
00:04:40,713 --> 00:04:43,319
PILOT: to feel the pain of your brothers and sisters...

104
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:45,814
CREW: which means you are feeling, in some kind of way,

105
00:04:45,814 --> 00:04:47,586
CREW: the weight of the world.

106
00:04:47,985 --> 00:04:50,605
PILOT: That's kind of like what humans feel a lot of the time.

107
00:04:50,605 --> 00:04:52,793
PILOT: And we think you feel that too.

108
00:04:54,192 --> 00:04:56,290
And the conscious zombie nodded.

109
00:04:57,990 --> 00:05:01,812
So it seems like the heaven that is being built needed the raw

110
00:05:01,812 --> 00:05:03,910
material of hell to be transformed

111
00:05:03,910 --> 00:05:05,584
into the material of heaven...

112
00:05:05,584 --> 00:05:08,911
and maybe for his brothers and sisters too.

113
00:05:09,312 --> 00:05:11,351
And that is why heaven sent the soul...

114
00:05:11,351 --> 00:05:13,346
to turn hell into heaven.
